[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692969399","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103475#issuecomment-2692969399","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103475","id":2692969399,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gg3O3","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-02T23:37:37Z","updated_at":"2025-03-02T23:37:37Z","body":"I checked the MRP, but it seems to only include the corrupted result? How to actually reproduce the problem and compare 4.3 and 4.4?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692969399/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2693423708","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103475#issuecomment-2693423708","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103475","id":2693423708,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gimJc","user":{"login":"aristides86","id":18696109,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4Njk2MTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18696109?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86","html_url":"https://github.com/aristides86","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-03T06:43:08Z","updated_at":"2025-03-03T06:56:18Z","body":"On the further inspection the problem is not with the vertex colors, but with the commit_to_surface() method of MeshDataTool. I'm using the vertex painter plugin. But even without modifying the mesh data commit_to_surface just scrambles the mesh. This is the code that causes problems\n```\nfunc _paint_tool() -> void:\n      var data = MeshDataTool.new()\n      data.create_from_surface(current_mesh.mesh, 0)\n      #nothing is changed\n      current_mesh.mesh.clear_surfaces()\n      data.commit_to_surface(current_mesh.mesh)\n```\nI'm including a simple project that just executes this code on project launch\n\n[commit_to_surface.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19048971/commit_to_surface.zip)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2693423708/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2693446914","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103475#issuecomment-2693446914","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103475","id":2693446914,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gir0C","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-03T06:57:29Z","updated_at":"2025-03-03T06:57:29Z","body":"Can you test earlier dev and beta builds to pinpoint when the issue was introduced?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2693446914/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2693497162","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103475#issuecomment-2693497162","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103475","id":2693497162,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gi4FK","user":{"login":"aristides86","id":18696109,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4Njk2MTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18696109?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86","html_url":"https://github.com/aristides86","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-03T07:28:11Z","updated_at":"2025-03-03T07:34:37Z","body":"You can open the project in 4.4 dev1 and launch it with the same result, but the mesh is fixed if you remove shadow mesh from its properties. In other versions imported meshes can be fixed if you fiddle with import settings. In dev1 the only import setting for OBJ's is tangent calculations and disabling it fixes the imported obj, so I guess something is happening on mesh import. But it seems the problem is with shadow meshes,","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2693497162/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2693526850","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103475#issuecomment-2693526850","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103475","id":2693526850,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gi_VC","user":{"login":"aristides86","id":18696109,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4Njk2MTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18696109?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86","html_url":"https://github.com/aristides86","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-03T07:44:45Z","updated_at":"2025-03-03T07:44:45Z","body":"I can also confirm that the original problem with vertex painting is resolved by removing the generated on import shadow mesh from the mesh properties and disabling it in import settings.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2693526850/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2696389500","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103475#issuecomment-2696389500","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103475","id":2696389500,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gt6N8","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T06:51:38Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T07:04:11Z","body":"Testing your second MRP with 4.3 and I am getting the same results as you are getting in 4.4. \n\n<img width=\"526\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b791d651-72f3-4a26-93c4-bf1724176937\" />\n\n\nIf I change the code to keep the same format as the original mesh, then it works in 4.3\n\n```\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar format = mesh.mesh.surface_get_format(0)\n\tvar data = MeshDataTool.new()\n\tdata.create_from_surface(mesh.mesh, 0)\n\t\n\t#nothing is changed\n\tmesh.mesh.clear_surfaces()\n\tdata.commit_to_surface(mesh.mesh, format)\n```\n\n_Edit: I can confirm this fixes the issue on 4.4 too. The behaviour is the same in 4.4 and 4.3 for me_","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2696389500/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2697013688","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103475#issuecomment-2697013688","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103475","id":2697013688,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gwSm4","user":{"login":"aristides86","id":18696109,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4Njk2MTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18696109?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86","html_url":"https://github.com/aristides86","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aristides86/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T10:35:45Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T10:35:45Z","body":"That's wonderful news. Although I couldn't find any information about this in docs. Is there any practical reason why mesh format shouldn't be preserved by default?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2697013688/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698606454","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103475#issuecomment-2698606454","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103475","id":2698606454,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6g2Xd2","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T18:57:24Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T18:57:24Z","body":"> That's wonderful news. Although I couldn't find any information about this in docs. Is there any practical reason why mesh format shouldn't be preserved by default?\n\nThat's the thing. The format _should_ be preserved and the code look like it does. You shouldn't be required to pass in the format like that. \n\nThe code is just a workaround for you for now until we figure out the cause and the proper solution!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698606454/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]